# taken from:
# https://umizame.github.io/S-box_29-AND/
# NIST project listing (2026 transformations of this construction):
# https://github.com/usnistgov/Circuits/blob/master/data/slp/aes/README.md
#
# 4 terminal NOT gates from the source circuit are folded into XNOR (~^)
# to match the counting/style of the other .unrail files.
#
# normalized interface: x0..x7 / s0..s7, index 0 = AES byte MSB.
#
# Unrail results:
# NL: total=29, DR=14, DR2SR_B2F=15
# L:  total=195, DR=94, SR_F2B=0, SR_B2F=101
# REG=8
#
# #gates:     224
# depth (NL):  34 (6)
# #L:          195
# #NL:         29
